                <td class="px-5 py-4">
                  <span class="mr-2">📣</span><strong>Social Media Shoutouts</strong>
                  <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
                    Multiple mentions across social media channels before, during, and after the event.
                  </p>
                </td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4 text-center text-xl">✓</td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4 text-center text-xl">✓</td>
